This cartridge generates sql from csv files.

There is a template for each type of cvs file. e.g.:

'config.csv'                   is handeled by 'config.sql.vm'
'user_person_driver_role.csv'  is handeled by 'user_person_driver_role.sql.vm'
etc

naming:

- the generated sql files will be located in a directory according to
the parent directory-name of the path in which the csv file resides
- the generated sql files will be named according to the input-csv
file with '.csv' replaced by '.sql' and 'insert_' as a prefix.

example:

in:    csv/refdata/config.csv
out:   outputdir/refdata/insert_config.sql
